# Stage 6 golden tour (M5, D-036 style): the real game from the title with
# the run started at the Wolfgangsee (`level = wolfgangsee`, D-047): START
# at frame 21, stage intro 21..170, then the inputs of
# wolfgangsee_solver.replay unchanged from frame 171 (re-copy them after
# `cargo xtask solve wolfgangsee --write`; the xtask tour coupling test
# checks it), then 800 idle frames: the Maibaum sequence, the tally, the
# route map Wolfgangsee -> Strobl, which has no level yet, so the teaser
# („Fortsetzung folgt …", D-072) and the title (5454) with the run reset.
# The solver route hops the bathing notch, rides the Dampfer from the quay
# (the scroll starts), sees swan #1 hiss and charge under the deck, swims
# the Seebad with Gelse #1 waiting at the water line behind her, passes
# the lantern pontoon (checkpoint), swims under the Traundl section and
# takes the regatta by diving and a masthead bounce, then the Strobl quay
# and a running jump off the landing hall to the Maibaum. Route re-copied
# in E32 (D-086: the solver found another route after the camera rest;
# same completion frame, shot frames unchanged).
